{"id":"c14","kind":"web","text":"Thariq 은 단계를 올리면 edge case 를 놓친 실패가 줄지만 잘못된 접근은 고쳐지지 않는다고 본다.","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"2026-10-25 수신 고정 사본(notes/web/w1.txt) 기준","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Higher effort levels help when there are many edge cases","quote":"Overall, increasing effort tends to reduce failures due to missing edgecases (purple blocks), but does not fix when the model has the wrong approach (blue blocks)."}]}
