{"id":"c16","kind":"web","text":"html-js-filter: low 시도는 약 2분, 필터를 한 번에 쓰고 손으로 쓴 페이지 하나로만 시험한다.","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"2026-10-25 수신 고정 사본(notes/web/w1.txt) 기준","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Higher effort levels help when there are many edge cases","quote":"A typical attempt at low effort takes about 2 minutes. Each of these attempts wrote a filter in roughly one pass, then tested it against a single hand-written page."}]}
{"id":"c17","kind":"web","text":"html-js-filter: high 실행은 약 33분, 첫 초안을 적대적으로 검토하고 parser 소스를 읽고 XSS 시험 묶음을 돌리고 fuzzer 를 쓴다.","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"2026-10-25 수신 고정 사본(notes/web/w1.txt) 기준","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Higher effort levels help when there are many edge cases","quote":"A high-effort run finishes in about 33 minutes. In the run I traced, it adversarially reviewed its first draft, then read the installed parser’s source to check for bugs"},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Higher effort levels help when there are many edge cases","quote":"ran many clean test cases until they gave the same output as the input, ran a standard XSS test suite, and finally, wrote a random-document fuzzer."}]}
{"id":"c18","kind":"web","text":"html-js-filter 에서 Fable 5.1 은 low 1/5 → xhigh 5/5.","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"2026-10-25 수신 고정 사본(notes/web/w1.txt) 기준","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Higher effort levels help when there are many edge cases","quote":"Fable 5.1 went from 1/5 at low to 5/5 at xhigh.¹"}]}
{"id":"c19","kind":"web","text":"mvcc-lsm-compaction: low(약 1분)는 빌드와 재현 전에 코드를 고치고 새 시험이 원래 버그를 잡는지 확인하지 않는다. xhigh(약 11분)는 crash 를 먼저 재현하고 compaction 없는 기준 구현과 무작위로 비교하며 덜 된 수정에서 시험이 실패하는지 본다. Opus 5.5 low 0/5 → xhigh 4/5.","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"2026-10-25 수신 고정 사본(notes/web/w1.txt) 기준","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Problem areas where effort helps","quote":"At low (about a minute per attempt), Claude would edit the code before building it or running the reproducer, and did not check that its new test would have caught the original bug."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Problem areas where effort helps","quote":"At xhigh (about 11 minutes), Claude reproduced the crash first, wrote a randomized test against a reference that never compacts, and checked that its tests failed on half-finished fixes."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Problem areas where effort helps","quote":"without breaking compaction. Opus 5.5 went from 0/5 at low to 4/5 at xhigh."}]}
{"id":"c20","kind":"web","text":"cli-2ph-simplex: low 는 작은 문제 몇 개로만 확인하고 약 10k 토큰에서 멈추며 큰 문제에서 느릴 수 있다고 경고만 한다. high 는 brute-force solver 와 무작위 문제로 비교하고 큰 문제의 시간을 재서 탐색을 다시 짠다. Opus 5.5 low 0/5 → high 5/5.","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"2026-10-25 수신 고정 사본(notes/web/w1.txt) 기준","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Problem areas where effort helps","quote":"The low attempts wrote a solver in one pass, checked it with a few small problems and stopped around 10k tokens. In the final message, Claude warned it might be slow on big problems, but did not check."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Problem areas where effort helps","quote":"During the high attempts, Claude tested its solver on random problems against a separate brute-force solver, then timed bigger ones, hit cases that ran far too long or crashed, and reworked its search."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Problem areas where effort helps","quote":"asks for a CLI linear-program solver written in Python. Opus 5.5 went from 0/5 at low to 5/5 at high."}]}
{"id":"c21","kind":"web","text":"gsea-proteomics: low 는 전처리 방법 하나로 분석을 한 번 돌리고, high 는 전처리를 두 가지로 해 보고 유의한 처리 목록이 달라지자 이유를 파고든다. Opus 5.5 low 0/5 → high 4/5.","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"2026-10-25 수신 고정 사본(notes/web/w1.txt) 기준","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Problem areas where effort helps","quote":"At low effort, Claude picked a reasonable-sounding way to prep the data, ran the analysis that one way, and reported the result."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Problem areas where effort helps","quote":"At high, Claude tried two ways of prepping the data, noticed that the list of significant treatments changed, and dug into why before choosing the correct one."},{"source":"w1","locator":"§Problem areas where effort helps","quote":"to find which of eight treatments resemble a target tissue. Opus 5.5 went from 0/5 at low to 4/5 at high."}]}
{"id":"c22","kind":"web","text":"Thariq 은 사용자가 루프에 있었다면 Claude 가 문제 설정을 물었을 수도 있고, 사용자가 없을 때는 높은 단계가 낫다고 본다.","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"2026-10-25 수신 고정 사본(notes/web/w1.txt) 기준","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"§Problem areas where effort helps","quote":"If a user were in the loop, Claude may have asked the user about the way to set up the problem, but without a user in the loop, high effort does better."}]}
{"id":"c23","kind":"web","text":"통과 횟수는 과제마다 5번 시도한 Anthropic 내부 실행이고 Fable 5.1 은 운영 안전 개입을 끈 채 돌렸다. 예시는 개별 실행에서 왔고 일부는 중간 단계다.","verdict":"confirmed","scope":"2026-10-25 수신 고정 사본(notes/web/w1.txt) 기준","evidence":[{"source":"w1","locator":"footnote 1","quote":"these come from our own internal runs, 5 attempts per task, with our production safety interventions off for Fable 5.1"},{"source":"w1","locator":"footnote 1","quote":"The worked examples come from individual runs, some at intermediate effort settings."}]}
